  "research_status": "COMPLETE — all 46 episodes of Sailor Moon (original 1992 season, before Sailor Moon R) classified canon/filler. 28 filler episodes (2-7, 9, 11-12, 15-18, 20-21, 26-32, 37-41, 43) confirmed by two independently-fetched sources (Looper's direct episode-by-episode list restricted to this season, ScreenRant's spot-checked filler episodes 4/15/31/32 — all four fall within Looper's filler ranges, no contradictions). The classic 90s anime and Takeuchi's manga are widely treated as separate continuities sharing only characters/setting; filler here means 'no manga chapter counterpart', same convention as every other show in this project. Episode titles sourced from Wikipedia's List of Sailor Moon episodes. CORRECTED 2026-08-27: episodes 13, 14, 23, 24, 36, 42 canon→mixed after Andreas's own manual cross-reference review of the full season.",
